<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank O/N repo ave yields dips to 18.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank O/N repo ave yields dips to 18.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at a Czech National Bank (CNB) overnight repo tender on Thursday dipped to 18.10 percent from 18.36 percent on Wednesday, the CNB said in a statement.</p>
<p>The CNB added that all bids were satisfied at the maximum yield of 18.11 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB does not announce the amount of funds it adds to the market through its operations.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
